Package: @PACKAGE_ID@
Name: fastfetch
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Description: fastfetch system information tool for jailbroken iOS
 A neofetch-like tool for fetching system information and displaying it
 prettily, cross-compiled for iOS and packaged for both roothide and
 rootless bootstraps from one arm64 build. The architecture field says
 which layout this package is, not which CPU it runs on. Upstream is
 @UPSTREAM@.
 .
 Run `fastfetch` in a terminal on device. Config lives in
 ~/.config/fastfetch/config.jsonc; presets are in /usr/share/fastfetch.
Maintainer: OwnGoal Studio <not-gonna-reply@owngoal.dev>
Author: Carter Li <https://github.com/fastfetch-cli/fastfetch>
Section: Utilities
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= @MIN_IOS@)
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
